# LPC176x boot/connect smoke test. The local lpc176x.repl is the only
# path - Renode upstream has no LPC176x platform and no LPC176x-
# specific peripheral models (lpc2294.repl is the older ARM7 LPC2000
# series and is unrelated). The repl pairs an upstream NS16550
# (wideRegisters: true matches the 32-bit-spaced LPC UART register
# layout) with the local LPC_SC stub - that stub is the chip-specific
# path that this test exercises end-to-end. printers.test reaches
# lpc176x via smoothieboard / btt-skr-1.x boards at config-parse
# depth; this is the firmware-boot regression target.
DICTIONARY lpc176x.dict
CONFIG lpc176x_smoke.cfg
EMULATOR lpc176x_smoke.fixture.json

M114
M105
M105
M105

EXPECT_LOG_CONTAINS "Loaded MCU 'mcu'"
EXPECT_LOG_NOT_CONTAINS "Internal error"
EXPECT_LOG_NOT_CONTAINS "Klippy is shutdown"
